{"id":"ji6h7xvx8hmpbjvh1w1wdi1dn","title":"宾夕法尼亚州签署 AI 广告披露法，要求 AI 生成广告加标签","originalTitle":"Pennsylvania will require labels on AI-generated ads","summary":"宾夕法尼亚州州长 Josh Shapiro 于周四签署《人工智能虚假广告法》，要求任何被人工智能显著修改或生成的广告（图片、视频、音频或文字）以与广告相同的形式标注标签，且不论广告在何处制作。该州是最早要求披露 AI 内容的州之一，其他州制作但将在宾州播出的广告也可能出现标注。法案留有多处漏洞，包括显著修改的定义主观、戏仿与明显虚构内容的豁免范围不清，以及何种情形构成对消费者的虚假认知仍待界定。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"The Verge · AI"},"links":{"original":"https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/1018187/pennsylvania-ai-deceptive-advertising-act"},"publishedAt":"2026-10-24T18:32:21.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-10-24T18:43:30.841Z","timelineAt":"2026-10-24T18:43:30.841Z","category":"industry","tags":["行业动态","政策/监管"],"score":51,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"6bd0fd73-f9bf-4e9e-85a8-b6449bdb08f0","title":"宾州签署AI广告披露法"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":"Terrence O’Brien","body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"6bd0fd73-f9bf-4e9e-85a8-b6449bdb08f0","title":"宾州签署AI广告披露法"}],"topics":[{"slug":"industry","name":"行业动态"},{"slug":"policy","name":"政策监管"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fst0Pow8XXd8","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}